--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Independent implementation
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Every algorithm in this project was implemented from published photogrammetric
literature and first principles. No part of it was derived from, ported from,
decompiled from, or reverse engineered out of any commercial product.

The mathematics is long-established public knowledge: the collinearity
condition, space resection, bundle block adjustment, normalised cross-
correlation, semi-global matching, and distance-transform seam selection are
all documented in the standard photogrammetry and computer vision literature.

